<title>USA: Metra says overseas sales of Immulite begin.</title>
<headline>Metra says overseas sales of Immulite begin.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metra Biosystems and Diagnostic Products Corp on Monday said Diagnostic Products has have begun overseas sales of the Immulite Pyrilinks automated test for bone resorption.</p>
<p>The test is based on Metra's Pyrilinks-D technology and will be available on Diagnostic Product's automated Immulite laboratory instrument.</p>
<p>Diagnostic Products has filed a premarket notification with the U.S. Food and Drug Administration to sell Immulite Pyrilinks-D in the United States and expects to receive clearance in the near future.</p>
</text>
